DESCRIPTION:Conditional Formulation of Gaussian Systems on Spatial Network
 s with Irregularly Distributed Points Join the Department of Statistics fo
 r a seminar featuring Debashis Mondal\, associate professor in the Departm
 ent of Statistics and Data Science at Washington University in St. Louis. 
 Abstract: In this talk I develop a mathematical and statistical framework 
 for analyzing spatial systems on irregularly distributed point locations. 
