 s on spatial networks with symmetric weights for both stationary and non-s
 tationary point processes. The framework associates these systems with rev
 ersible Markov chains and\, through Kipnis--Varad\nCategory: Academic\nOri
 ginal listing: https://calendar.gwu.edu/event/statistics-seminar-series-co
 nditional-formulation-of-gaussian-systems-on-spatial-networks-with-irregul
 arly-distributed-points
