 a diagnosis. This session explores the latest brain health research alongs
 ide the growing movement to build dementia-friendly communities\, challeng
 ing stereotypes and examining what a society-wide response looks like in b
 oth policy and practice. Speakers Tesha Coleman - Program Manager\, DC Bra
