 ates
DESCRIPTION:Pitch to Win! Entrepreneurs must be able to communicate their 
 ideas clearly\, concisely\, and persuasively. This workshop teaches partic
 ipants how to transform their business thesis into a compelling elevator p
 itch and introductory pitch deck. Students learn storytelling techniques a
 nd how to communicate their venture’s value in a way that resonates with
  customers\, judges\, mentors\, and investors. This workshop helps student
 s craft their elevator pitch for the Pitch George Competition hosted by th
 e Center for Entrepreneurial Excellence.\nCategory: Lectures & Speakers\nO
 riginal listing: https://calendar.gwu.edu/event/pitching-to-win-fall-2026
